<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday it had cut its rating for Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette, a unit of Equitable Cos Inc, to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the New York investment and merchant bank closed on Monday at 43-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
